Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Foggy Intersection with Vehicles and Buildings" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasActor :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .
:actor1 a :Vehicle .
:actor2 a :Vehicle .
:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .
:obstacle1 a :RoadObject .
:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision due to reduced visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
:risk2 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Potential driver distraction from foggy conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .
:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

